*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment. Bun auto-loads .env, .env.local and the NODE_ENV overlays (.env.development,
# .env.production, .env.test), and any of them can hold a token. Ignore every form and allow only
# the documented example back in.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Shared-core rosters. This repository owns no group and holds no roster: they live with the one
# owner. But a roster names every private sibling a group syncs to, and this repository is public.
# Ignoring the whole name shape costs one line and removes the only way one could ever be committed
# by accident.
/*-targets.json

# The gate runner's step cache and the temporary file it writes while saving (smokestack
# runner-step-cache, clause 8). Local to this machine; never committed or delivered.
/.smokestack-cache.json
/.smokestack-cache.json.*.tmp
